# Where the books live. Set BOTH to run the app against a Supabase project (sign-in required, the company is stored online),
# or leave BOTH unset to run with the books in this browser (development, and the browser tests: no sign-in).
#
# The anon key is public by design (it ships in the page; row-level security and the Edge Function decide what it can do).
# NEVER put the service_role key or a personal access token here: Vite would publish it.
#
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local (git-ignored) for local development against the cloud project.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-or-publishable-key>
